================================================
RECOMMENDATIONS
================================================
1. Verify current running firmware matches boot configuration
2. Review available firmware versions against Cisco advisories
3. Ensure sufficient flash space before firmware upgrades
4. Always backup configuration before firmware changes
5. Use "show version" to verify running firmware
6. Use "show bootvar" to verify boot configuration

================================================
NEXT STEPS (if upgrading)
================================================
1. Backup current configuration
2. Verify new firmware image integrity (MD5 hash)
3. Copy firmware to flash if not present
4. Set boot system to new firmware:
   conf t
   no boot system
   boot system flash:<new-firmware-image>
   end
   write memory
5. Reload router at appropriate maintenance window
6. Verify new firmware after reload

================================================
